# [[ .GitopsRepoName ]]

The gitops repo for **[[ .OrgName ]]**'s Infrared management cluster
**[[ .ClusterName ]]** ([[ .ClusterFlavor ]][[ if .Region ]], [[ .Region ]][[ end ]]).

Infrared created this repo from
[infrared-gitops-template](https://github.com/darkshiftio/infrared-gitops-template)
[[ .TemplateVersion ]] when it bootstrapped the cluster (Infrared
[[ .InfraredVersion ]], chart `[[ .InfraredChartRepo ]]/infrared`
[[ .InfraredChartVersion ]]). From here on, **this repo is the cluster**: Argo CD
syncs it, and a change lands by pull request, not by `kubectl` or `helm`.

## Layout

```
registry/clusters/[[ .ClusterName ]]/
  registry.yaml            the root app-of-apps (Application registry-[[ .ClusterName ]])
  components/              one Application per component, in sync-wave order
  values/infrared.yaml     yours, optional: values for the Infrared chart (see "Configuring Infrared")
components/
  appprojects/             AppProjects platform and infrared
  argocd/                  Argo CD, vendored and pinned; Argo CD manages itself from here
  builds/                  kpack builder and build credentials[[ if not .BuildRegistry ]] (off: no build registry)[[ end ]]
[[- if eq .Edge "gateway" ]]
  edge/                    the Gateway, its origin certificate and the edge's routes
  external-dns/            external-dns's Cloudflare token, copied from the platform's tokens
[[- end ]]
  infisical/               creates the Secret infisical/infisical-secrets on first sync
  kpack/                   kpack, vendored and pinned
[[- if eq .Edge "gateway" ]]
  platform-tokens/         ClusterSecretStore infrared-platform, over the Secret infrared-platform-tokens
[[- end ]]
[[- if .Stores ]]
  postgres/                the platform's one Postgres: a CloudNativePG Cluster, a role and a database per consumer
[[- end ]]
products/                  yours: one directory per product (see "Products")
```

